Package: ucdpR
Title: Access and Work with Uppsala Conflict Data Program Data
Version: 0.3.4
Authors@R: person("Christian", "Oswald", email = "christian.oswald@unibw.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for reproducible research with datasets published
    by the Uppsala Conflict Data Program ('UCDP') <https://ucdp.uu.se/>. It
    discovers the official download catalog at run time, downloads and imports
    current or historical releases, records source metadata, and helps examine
    changes between dataset versions. UCDP data are not bundled or modified.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/christianoswald/ucdpR, https://christianoswald.github.io/ucdpR/
BugReports: https://github.com/christianoswald/ucdpR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
